---
// Visual showdown: selling 100M VND investment at +10% gain vs -10% loss.
// Shows 0.1% gross PIT tax deducted in BOTH cases (at 0.15% broker commission).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="sbp4-tax">
  <div class="sbp4-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison of selling 4,000 shares bought for 100 million VND: at +10% (110M gross), 165k fee and 110k tax leave 109.725M; at -10% (90M gross), 135k fee and 90k tax are still deducted, leaving 89.775M.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp4-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why the 0.1% sell tax still bills you when you sell at a loss (bought 100M VND, 0.15% fee)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vì sao thuế bán 0,1% vẫn thu dù bạn đang cắt lỗ (vốn mua 100 triệu, phí 0,15%)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left: +10% profit */}
      <rect x="20" y="54" width="415" height="210" rx="10" class="sbp4-card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={48} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="72" y="89" class="sbp4-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Exit at +10% (sell for 110,000,000 VND)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bán chốt lãi +10% (giá trị bán 110.000.000 đ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="130" class="sbp4-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Sell broker fee (0.15%): −165,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phí bán CTCK (0,15%): −165.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="162" class="sbp4-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 0.1% sell tax on 110M: −110,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thuế bán 0,1% trên 110 triệu: −110.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="40" y1="186" x2="415" y2="186" class="sbp4-sep" />
      <text x="40" y="218" class="sbp4-hdr">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net cash back: 109,725,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền thực nhận: 109.725.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="40" y="244" class="sbp4-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Tax is 0.1% of gross sale, not 0.1% of profit</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thuế tính 0,1% tổng giá trị bán, không tính trên lãi</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: -10% loss */}
      <rect x="465" y="54" width="415" height="210" rx="10" class="sbp4-card sbp4-card-red" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={493} y={84} size={24} />
      <text x="517" y="89" class="sbp4-hdr sbp4-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Exit at −10% (sell for 90,000,000 VND)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bán cắt lỗ −10% (giá trị bán 90.000.000 đ)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="485" y="130" class="sbp4-body">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• Sell broker fee (0.15%): −135,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Phí bán CTCK (0,15%): −135.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="485" y="162" class="sbp4-body sbp4-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>• 0.1% sell tax on 90M: −90,000 VND (still paid!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>• Thuế bán 0,1% trên 90 triệu: −90.000 đ (vẫn thu!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <line x1="485" y1="186" x2="860" y2="186" class="sbp4-sep" />
      <text x="485" y="218" class="sbp4-hdr sbp4-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Net cash back: 89,775,000 VND</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tiền thực nhận: 89.775.000 đồng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="485" y="244" class="sbp4-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Withheld automatically before cash settles</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khấu trừ tự động ngay khi khớp lệnh bán</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Vietnam taxes individual stock sales as 0.1% of gross sale proceeds rather than net capital gains. You pay the 0.1% tax automatically whether you sell at +10% or −10%.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thuế TNCN chuyển nhượng chứng khoán tính cố định 0,1% trên tổng giá trị bán chứ không tính trên phần lãi ròng. Dù bạn chốt lời +10% hay cắt lỗ −10%, khoản 0,1% này đều tự động trừ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp4-tax { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp4-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp4-tax svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp4-tax text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp4-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp4-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .sbp4-card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp4-hdr { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp4-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp4-body { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .sbp4-sub { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp4-sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .sbp4-tax figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
